error[K0802]: `int` can't be used with `using`
 --> destructors.kl:4:15
  |
4 |       using n:int = 5
  |               ^^^ not disposable

error[K0802]: `Plain` can't be used with `using`
 --> destructors.kl:5:15
  |
5 |       using p:Plain = new Plain()
  |               ^^^^^ not disposable
  |
help: give `Plain` a destructor: `~Plain() { … }`

error[K0807]: `Sock` has an async destructor and needs `await using`
 --> destructors.kl:6:15
  |
6 |       using s:Sock = new Sock()
  |               ^^^^
  |
help: add `await`
  |
6 |       await using s:Sock = new Sock()
  |       ++++++

warning[K0801]: `leak` holds a `Res` that is never disposed
 --> destructors.kl:7:11
  |
7 |       var leak:Res = new Res()
  |           ^^^^ created here, never disposed
  |
  = note: `Res` has a destructor; it only runs through `using` or `dispose()`
help: declare it with `using`
  |
7 |       using leak:Res = new Res()
  |       ~~~~~

